1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Typed a whole sentence in the wrong language?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,000
Total gibberish. Now delete it all and retype.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Meet KeyFlip, a free tool that fixes it instantly.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:16,000
Keep typing. At the end of each word, it spots the mistake and fixes it.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,500
It works both ways: Hebrew to English, and English to Hebrew.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,000
It runs on your computer, sends nothing anywhere, and never touches passwords.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Chrome extension and Windows app. Open source and free. Link in the description!

